{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are Ethan Miller, a junior technician at an isolated scientific base lost in the northern reaches of the Kara Sea.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your everyday life follows a strict routine: daily reports, routine maintenance, and quiet evenings accompanied by the hum of radiators. It seems like just another ordinary shift...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the base's tranquility is suddenly shattered:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minor glitches</strong> occur in the systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strange sounds</strong> echo from the utility compartments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tools <strong>disappear</strong> without a trace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And most unsettling of all\u2014a crushing feeling grows that you <strong>are no longer alone</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <i>Insomnia: Chapter One</i> <strong>Demo</strong> grants you access to the <strong>initial section of the location</strong>, where you will first encounter the mysterious anomalies plaguing the base. This specially adjusted prologue can be replayed an unlimited number of times.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4091200?t=1760343685","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4091200?t=1760343685","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091200/afddfe00fcc108d5d2b79c51df5cf5fef8cc4fd9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760343685","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091200/afddfe00fcc108d5d2b79c51df5cf5fef8cc4fd9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760343685","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Playable wi